WEBVTT

00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:11.365
Have I said something?

00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:16.152
RON:
She's gone mental,

00:00:16.196 --> 00:00:17.588
Hermione has.

00:00:17.632 --> 00:00:19.503
I mean, not that she
wasn't always mental,

00:00:19.547 --> 00:00:23.551
but now it's out in the
open for everyone to see.

00:00:23.594 --> 00:00:25.379
Hang on.

00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:27.511
We better take this back.

00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:28.730
I'm not going back.

00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:31.254
Fine.
See you later.

00:00:31.298 --> 00:00:32.603
See you.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:16.168
[ whispering]:
Harry Potter.

00:01:20.825 --> 00:01:22.871
[ gasping]

00:01:22.914 --> 00:01:24.655
Professor Trelawney.

00:01:24.699 --> 00:01:26.831
[ eerie multiple voices]:
He will return tonight.

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:28.224
Sorry?

00:01:28.268 --> 00:01:31.140
Tonight, he
who betrayed his friends,

00:01:31.183 --> 00:01:34.622
whose heart rots with murder,
shall break free.

00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:37.320
Innocent blood
shall be spilt,

00:01:37.364 --> 00:01:39.540
and Servant
and Master

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:42.020
shall be reunited once more.

00:01:42.064 --> 00:01:45.285
[ chokes and coughs]

00:01:45.328 --> 00:01:47.548
[ hacks]

00:01:47.591 --> 00:01:51.552
[ normal voice]:
Oh, I'm so sorry, dear boy.

00:01:51.595 --> 00:01:53.597
Did you say
something?

00:01:53.641 --> 00:01:55.947
No.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:58.341
Nothing.

00:02:07.611 --> 00:02:11.528
[ panting]

00:02:19.057 --> 00:02:21.016
[ metallic scraping]

00:02:21.059 --> 00:02:23.845
[ cawing]

00:02:23.888 --> 00:02:27.457
[ metallic scraping]

00:02:27.501 --> 00:02:33.855
[ bell tolling]

00:02:33.898 --> 00:02:37.119
[ metallic scraping]

